Now I'll admit that the raid speeds are a little under par with what I said
earlier however bear in mind that this is software raid0 and that on the dual
UP2000 it does hit about 50-55Mb/s

As for SRM not noticing the ATA100 controller, the way around that is to ensure
that the /boot partition is available off somethint SRM does understand. In my
case this is from the disk attached to the onboard controller

