Eugene Chu wrote:
> 
> Hi Wes,
> 
> Thanks for the reply.
> 
> Do you know of anyone using 1.7 GHz processors?  (besides me)
> I think the boxes that my mobos came in say 850GB/850GBAL, but I'm
> not certain which one I actually have.  What is the difference between
> the two?
> 
